{
  "about": "GR III 2.20 / GR IIIx 1.70: the development tools and the equivalence test, generated from 2.10 / 1.60's. The program itself is fw/gr3x with fw/gr3x170's target (core/src/fw/release.ts). GR Mod Film: its own GR III 2.10 / IIIx 1.60 tools (the film mode's probes, `exclude` after `fixtures`) are not ported: the film mode is built on 2.10 / 1.60 only.",
